            "recorded_sha256": "e5c3587a3e216554e030c6d8ad5e62e48d211694100e403caa10c59c7aff70bd",
            "content": "---\nid: isolation-narrowing\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Narrow what review isolation excludes\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0007. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nExcluding the whole session log took the findings of the previous review with it.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Exclude the developer's reasoning; keep prior review entries.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A remediation review reads the findings it is remediating.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "e5c3587a3e216554e030c6d8ad5e62e48d211694100e403caa10c59c7aff70bd"
          },
          {
            "draft_id": "loader-rewrite",
            "state": "declined",
            "experiment_id": null,
            "decided_at": "2026-06-04T15:00:00Z",
            "reason": "the deploy-time rendering it proposes is a payload change, not a protocol one",
            "recorded_sha256": "e60db3157adf0bc51c9219265e171bf952903f48af8a11c9d2d4b4ccd755feaf",
            "content": "---\nid: loader-rewrite\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Rewrite the loader as a generated file\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0007. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nThe loader's imports are maintained by hand in three places.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Generate the eager import block at deploy from one mapping.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A new eager topic reaches all three agents from one edit.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "aff3d6a24c9f7d0f641032c1a120e3106909f54a416fd2f0caa9e6978808c4f1"
          },
          {
            "draft_id": "prefetch-injection",
            "state": "consumed",
            "experiment_id": "evolution-batch-0007-exp-01",
            "decided_at": "2026-06-03T09:40:00Z",
            "reason": null,
            "recorded_sha256": "32776f9dd759fcfc205339aea7e66e8903e542cc1a094985f52af9a99b8bd0e2",
            "content": "---\nid: prefetch-injection\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Inject prefetch documents into the session prompt\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0007. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nA declared prefetch list is a hint nothing delivers, so the first act of every session is a read the taskfile already named.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Render each `prefetch:` path into the invocation prompt.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A session with a prefetch list opens no file the list already named.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "32776f9dd759fcfc205339aea7e66e8903e542cc1a094985f52af9a99b8bd0e2"
          },
