            "recorded_sha256": "58ad15a109bc703ae7cd372812fe17cbd8b4c3aa4d9dcd4136b66f9b9b76841f",
            "content": "---\nid: review-isolation\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Keep a review session off the dev session's reasoning\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0007. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nA reviewer handed the developer's account of the change reviews the account.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Deliver the diff and the contract, never the dev session log.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- The review contract states what a reviewer is given and what it is not.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "58ad15a109bc703ae7cd372812fe17cbd8b4c3aa4d9dcd4136b66f9b9b76841f"
